From 7ca4534dfe469254ea93005f394364b3c20bdcd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rawdanger-recomp <rawdanger-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:24:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rawdanger-recomp v0.9.7: a livelier hero

In the bone call: snaps of more than 23 degrees in a bone's local turn go
half the way each step; the chest and spine get breathing standing still,
a hunch when wet, shivering when cold and a lean into turns, turned in the
world so the head and arms follow. Settings > Controls > Livelier hero
(keys.ini anim_layers, on); Settings > Debug: the layers four times bigger.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
